WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:34.900
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.400 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 3]

01:38.039 --> 01:38.630
My Lord,

01:39.229 --> 01:40.039
turn it.

01:43.870 --> 01:46.120
I meant turn the map, not you.

01:57.520 --> 01:58.850
She's planning to flee.

01:59.770 --> 02:01.370
She is indeed planning to flee.

02:01.370 --> 02:02.400
But she intends

02:02.430 --> 02:05.360
to clean out our Demons' Valley
before she runs away.

02:10.389 --> 02:12.140
Why does she want to steal carrots?

02:12.140 --> 02:13.070
That's ginseng.

02:17.240 --> 02:19.570
She even wants to steal
the mushrooms, too.

02:19.570 --> 02:20.520
That's lingzhi.

02:26.570 --> 02:27.720
You must protect

02:28.160 --> 02:29.760
this snow lotus at all costs.

02:31.890 --> 02:33.050
Please rest assured, My Lord.

02:33.050 --> 02:34.980
The snow lotus is absolutely safe.

02:35.020 --> 02:37.150
Because what Xiao Yao wants to steal is

02:37.180 --> 02:38.460
the cordyceps.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.910
She is acting way too wildly.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.540
I must give her a serious punishment.

02:47.490 --> 02:48.680
A serious punishment.

02:48.680 --> 02:50.010
There's one more thing.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.079
The red-thread demon

02:51.079 --> 02:52.870
lost a pair of red matchmaking threads.

02:52.870 --> 02:54.600
I've already checked
all the little demons,

02:54.600 --> 02:55.890
but so far,

02:55.920 --> 02:57.920
there's been no mismatched couple.

02:58.220 --> 02:59.880
Those matchmaking threads are

02:59.880 --> 03:00.940
no big deal.

03:18.040 --> 03:18.970
Why are you here?

03:29.570 --> 03:30.970
Are you looking for this?

03:34.110 --> 03:35.570
My h-head hurts.

03:36.070 --> 03:37.000
I feel so dizzy.

03:37.240 --> 03:40.410
I'm afraid I won't be able
to attend classes for the next few days.

03:40.410 --> 03:41.020
Is that so?

03:41.990 --> 03:42.920
Let me treat you.

03:45.810 --> 03:47.150
What on earth have I done to offend you?

03:47.150 --> 03:48.600
Why are you teasing me like this?

03:48.600 --> 03:50.660
So you noticed that I was teasing you.

03:51.260 --> 03:51.790
You...

03:52.380 --> 03:54.040
Before the second phase ends,

03:54.400 --> 03:56.800
you should just
have a good rest in this hut.

03:56.870 --> 03:58.329
Don't go to class anymore.

04:02.170 --> 04:02.710
Hold on.

04:03.100 --> 04:04.890
How long will the second phase last?

04:04.890 --> 04:06.510
It could be as short as 3 to 5 days,

04:06.510 --> 04:08.100
or as long as 10 days to half a month,

04:08.100 --> 04:10.100
depending on how well we're in sync.

04:10.840 --> 04:12.000
No, no, no. Wait!

04:12.120 --> 04:13.400
I don't agree with this.

04:13.400 --> 04:15.360
You told me to learn quickly
and return to the human world,

04:15.360 --> 04:17.220
but now you're confining me here?

04:17.269 --> 04:18.920
If you don't let me go, I'll go anyway.

04:18.920 --> 04:19.720
I don't believe

04:19.720 --> 04:20.870
you'll follow me every day,

04:20.870 --> 04:22.730
giving up your cultivation time.

04:24.110 --> 04:24.970
How about this?

04:25.810 --> 04:26.810
Let's make a deal.

04:27.900 --> 04:30.000
I'll allow you to attend classes
on Moon-Gazing Terrace,

04:30.000 --> 04:32.150
but you must focus on your cultivation.

04:32.150 --> 04:33.250
If you can make it,

04:33.620 --> 04:35.950
I'll give you anything marked on this map.

04:36.520 --> 04:37.640
As much as you want.

04:39.190 --> 04:39.840
For real?

04:40.270 --> 04:40.830
For real.

04:41.330 --> 04:42.659
You just need to remember

04:42.659 --> 04:44.120
not to cause trouble again

04:44.220 --> 04:46.350
or mess up the order of Demons' Valley.

04:46.760 --> 04:48.110
That's a deal.

04:50.430 --> 04:52.170
This time, I must teach that bamboo

04:52.170 --> 04:53.290
a good lesson.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.510
Digging up some bamboo shoots

04:56.510 --> 04:57.720
won't hurt him much.

04:58.230 --> 04:59.820
If humans got him,

05:00.160 --> 05:02.360
they'd uproot the whole bamboo!

05:02.360 --> 05:02.830
Yeah.

05:03.150 --> 05:04.370
Xiao Yao, listen.

05:04.600 --> 05:07.000
Humans are terrifying, you know?

05:07.060 --> 05:09.130
Back then, they claimed

05:09.160 --> 05:10.750
to love beautiful, blooming flowers,

05:10.750 --> 05:12.040
but they always cut off our roots,

05:12.040 --> 05:13.900
making us unable to grow anymore.

05:13.940 --> 05:16.330
I endured decades
of trials and tribulations

05:16.330 --> 05:17.510
and just gained consciousness,

05:17.510 --> 05:20.440
only to nearly get killed by humans.

05:20.870 --> 05:22.040
To survive

05:22.040 --> 05:23.560
and keep humans from discovering me,

05:23.560 --> 05:24.510
I had to

05:24.510 --> 05:26.940
shed my petals one by one,

05:27.000 --> 05:29.000
struggling until I could transform
into human form.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.200
Humans are two-faced

05:30.210 --> 05:31.140
and ruthless.

05:31.170 --> 05:32.130
My mom said

05:32.750 --> 05:34.560
that they fed and kept us well,

05:34.630 --> 05:35.240
but every once in a while,

05:35.240 --> 05:37.270
they'd put red ribbons
on the best of our ancestors

05:37.270 --> 05:38.330
and take them away.

05:38.920 --> 05:39.890
Not until one day

05:40.560 --> 05:41.960
when my mother witnessed

05:43.270 --> 05:45.190
my grandfather being butchered by humans

05:45.190 --> 05:45.750
did I realize

05:45.750 --> 05:47.800
that our ancestors who never returned

05:47.800 --> 05:49.360
had all been slaughtered by humans!

05:49.360 --> 05:49.830
Yeah!

05:51.190 --> 05:52.070
After that,

05:52.360 --> 05:53.850
my mother kept me starving every day.

05:53.850 --> 05:55.750
Sometimes I felt so dizzy due to hunger

05:55.750 --> 05:57.530
and couldn't even see my mother clearly.

05:57.530 --> 05:59.590
But she said she was trying to save me.

06:01.090 --> 06:03.290
One year, when humans suffered famine,

06:03.360 --> 06:05.830
that family sent us all
to the butcher's place.

06:05.830 --> 06:07.430
I was terrified at that time!

06:07.510 --> 06:08.440
It was my mother.

06:08.500 --> 06:10.240
My mother frantically charged forward

06:10.240 --> 06:11.120
and rushed out,

06:11.120 --> 06:12.480
risking her life to shove them away

06:12.480 --> 06:13.720
and even smashing the pigpen,

06:13.720 --> 06:15.180
so I could finally escape.

06:16.430 --> 06:16.990
Later,

06:17.070 --> 06:19.070
I wandered around aimlessly

06:19.160 --> 06:20.360
until I ate some divine herbs.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.800
I had my powers grow gradually

06:21.800 --> 06:23.120
and finally transform
into human form.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.340
Someday,

06:24.430 --> 06:25.680
after I drink the Yuli Spring,

06:25.680 --> 06:27.010
I will find those humans

06:27.070 --> 06:28.800
and seek justice for my family.

06:28.840 --> 06:29.310
Mm!

06:29.410 --> 06:29.870
Mm!

06:33.040 --> 06:33.950
Actually,

06:34.600 --> 06:35.520
humans,

06:36.390 --> 06:37.600
just like demons,

06:37.840 --> 06:40.240
also have good guys
and bad ones among them.

06:41.190 --> 06:42.510
Humans are more terrifying, though.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.570
You three...

06:52.000 --> 06:53.430
My bamboo shoots!

06:53.720 --> 06:54.990
Run!

06:55.470 --> 06:56.690
Run quickly!

06:57.120 --> 06:58.030
Luoluo! Dali!

06:58.240 --> 06:59.100
Come over here!

07:00.330 --> 07:01.420
I-If I catch you,

07:01.510 --> 07:01.970
I'll...

07:04.160 --> 07:05.000
You...

07:05.000 --> 07:05.950
Stop right there!

07:05.950 --> 07:06.760
Stop running!

07:08.830 --> 07:09.430
Come here!

07:12.040 --> 07:12.540
Stop...

07:13.560 --> 07:14.020
Stop...

07:15.710 --> 07:17.240
What is her true form again?

07:18.910 --> 07:19.630
It's a bird.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.600
No, it's a snake!

07:47.870 --> 07:48.970
♪ My heart braves countless tribulations ♪

07:50.370 --> 07:52.090
♪ Seeking the prophecy of fate ♪

07:54.090 --> 07:55.350
♪ Memories are flickering ♪

07:56.650 --> 07:58.690
♪ Our fingertips touched,
and then passed ♪

08:00.210 --> 08:02.270
♪ Binding silent wishes,
witnessed by the heaven and earth ♪

08:03.560 --> 08:05.750
♪ I'm only waiting for you ♪

08:04.070 --> 08:05.920
I told you to take care of yourself

08:05.920 --> 08:07.120
and not to drag me into your mess.

08:07.120 --> 08:09.110
♪ In a breath,
travel over millions of years ♪

08:07.410 --> 08:08.470
But what did you do?

08:08.830 --> 08:10.610
You still acted recklessly
and caused trouble.

08:10.610 --> 08:12.500
♪ To rewrite it ♪

08:10.760 --> 08:12.890
I will certainly punish you severely.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.750
We share feelings and senses.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.540
♪ The obsession of my life ♪

08:14.750 --> 08:16.810
Punishing me is punishing yourself.

08:16.960 --> 08:18.550
♪ Has never perished
in the reincarnation ♪

08:19.640 --> 08:22.070
♪ At the very beginning of all worlds,
I'd give up everything ♪

08:23.710 --> 08:28.580
♪To reverse time and space
just to find my most beloved ♪

08:30.130 --> 08:32.490
♪ Even if I have to lose my love again ♪

08:33.780 --> 08:35.600
♪ I only wish
to return to our first meeting ♪

08:37.140 --> 08:39.059
♪ Let the restricted longing ♪

08:40.600 --> 08:42.860
♪ Break the boundary of heaven and earth ♪

08:44.190 --> 08:45.810
♪ One thought turned love
into a fated calamity ♪

08:47.160 --> 08:49.120
♪ If we pray in tears ♪

08:49.870 --> 08:51.120
How did you get hurt?

08:50.640 --> 08:52.570
♪ In the vast mortal world ♪

08:52.840 --> 08:53.840
What do you think?

08:53.970 --> 08:55.940
♪ Just to see you ♪

08:57.240 --> 08:59.270
♪ Once again ♪

08:58.030 --> 08:59.560
That left a wound on my face!

08:59.590 --> 09:00.160
Hey,

09:00.200 --> 09:01.440
it's fine that you got wounded,

09:01.440 --> 09:03.250
but don't drag me down with you.

09:04.480 --> 09:06.880
Which matters more,
your face or your life?

09:07.190 --> 09:08.320
Life matters.

09:08.320 --> 09:10.030
But if life is not in danger,

09:10.030 --> 09:12.230
then face is certainly most important.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.210
Didn't you feel pain when dropping me?

09:42.910 --> 09:43.440
Those...

09:43.470 --> 09:44.880
Those! Those over there.

09:44.900 --> 09:45.700
What are they?

09:47.540 --> 09:48.380
Qiongqi,

09:49.510 --> 09:50.150
Ao Hen,

09:51.290 --> 09:52.100
Tengshe.

09:53.390 --> 09:55.520
They all look awesome and formidable.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.180
Compared to you,

09:57.240 --> 09:58.500
who would be stronger?

10:01.430 --> 10:03.090
There's no chance to compare.

10:03.390 --> 10:05.590
They were all ancient mythical beasts.

10:06.320 --> 10:08.580
They perished in the war against humans.

10:09.550 --> 10:10.750
To commemorate them,

10:11.320 --> 10:14.050
the demons carved their images
on the mountains.

10:14.540 --> 10:17.630
Their physical bodies
already perished 10,000 years ago.

10:17.630 --> 10:20.630
So humans and demons
have been fighting for so long.

10:57.790 --> 10:58.270
What?

11:03.200 --> 11:03.920
My Lord,

11:04.030 --> 11:06.890
I specially made
this roasted bamboo shoot for you.

11:07.550 --> 11:08.680
Please give it a try.

11:11.090 --> 11:12.420
It's really palatable.

11:26.600 --> 11:27.600
How does it taste?

11:27.840 --> 11:28.570
Not bad, huh?

11:29.870 --> 11:30.320
Mm.

11:43.040 --> 11:44.640
Please don't keep this scar.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.030
It will heal soon.

12:05.670 --> 12:06.360
My Lord,

12:06.400 --> 12:08.240
could you teach me

12:08.240 --> 12:10.000
that bubble spell?

12:11.550 --> 12:13.160
As long as you practice diligently,

12:13.160 --> 12:15.760
you'll pick up
way more than this in the future.

12:15.840 --> 12:16.630
But

12:16.630 --> 12:18.630
the progress in class is too slow.

12:18.670 --> 12:20.890
When will I be able to master it?

12:21.390 --> 12:23.450
As long as you're focused on studying

12:24.150 --> 12:26.080
instead of digging bamboo shoots,

12:26.200 --> 12:27.550
tricking turtles for their shells,

12:27.550 --> 12:29.550
or coveting wolf fur and deer antlers,

12:29.550 --> 12:32.880
you'll eventually get the hang of them
with daily practice.

12:32.900 --> 12:34.000
I have a question for you.

12:34.000 --> 12:35.870
Is it true that when you reach
the highest level of cultivation,

12:35.870 --> 12:37.440
you'll become free from all desires

12:37.440 --> 12:39.770
with no demand for food or drinks anymore?

12:39.840 --> 12:40.440
Sure.

12:42.080 --> 12:44.690
Then I'd rather not cultivate too well.

12:44.840 --> 12:47.320
Otherwise, everything would taste bland
when I return to the human realm.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.050
That would be such a loss for me.

12:56.100 --> 12:58.100
You look so handsome when you smile.

12:59.910 --> 13:01.700
Why don't you smile more often?

13:02.000 --> 13:04.800
Is it because you've
suffered too much in the past?

13:08.600 --> 13:10.000
The eight sufferings of life,

13:10.000 --> 13:11.530
I've experienced them all.

13:12.230 --> 13:13.560
What eight sufferings?

13:13.840 --> 13:17.720
Birth, aging, sickness, death.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.870
Separation from the beloved.

13:20.870 --> 13:22.200
Prolonged resentment.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.620
Unfulfilled desires.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.610
Inability to let go.

13:26.510 --> 13:28.310
You've been through all of them?

13:40.190 --> 13:41.150
Have a good rest.

13:47.380 --> 13:50.640
Looks like I made him recall
something sad again.

13:50.720 --> 13:52.150
This old demon.

13:55.460 --> 13:56.740
Today,

13:57.040 --> 14:00.490
we're going to talk
about the nine-tailed fox first.

14:01.030 --> 14:03.080
It's a fox-shaped beast

14:03.770 --> 14:06.480
with four legs and nine tails.

14:07.150 --> 14:08.390
It devours humans.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.790
Eating their flesh

14:11.050 --> 14:13.250
can ward off evil.

14:15.120 --> 14:16.070
Do you know that?

14:16.800 --> 14:18.440
The red-thread demon's...

14:18.510 --> 14:20.840
His red matchmaking threads are
still missing.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.560
He's almost losing his mind
due to anxiety.

14:22.560 --> 14:23.390
Really?

14:26.840 --> 14:29.390
So you know
about the red matchmaking threads, too?

14:29.390 --> 14:30.720
It's common knowledge.

14:30.790 --> 14:32.390
Don't tell me you don't know.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.870
Of course I know.

14:36.670 --> 14:39.270
The red matchmaking threads
have three phases.

14:39.270 --> 14:40.120
In the first phase,

14:40.120 --> 14:42.270
the couple cannot be
more than 10 feet apart.

14:42.270 --> 14:42.960
In the second phase,

14:42.960 --> 14:44.750
the couple shares feelings and senses.

14:44.750 --> 14:46.680
As for the third phase...

14:55.530 --> 14:56.920
Do you really know?

15:00.170 --> 15:01.170
Next,

15:02.240 --> 15:05.080
let's move on

15:05.670 --> 15:06.870
to ancient sayings.

15:07.600 --> 15:10.520
"Water flows from high rocks

15:11.000 --> 15:13.510
and runs westward
to merge into the river."

15:13.510 --> 15:14.600
Pair cultivation?

15:15.870 --> 15:17.750
What is pair cultivation?

15:51.130 --> 15:54.190
Seems like you're giving up
on untying the red threads.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.670
I don't want to do pair cultivation!

16:03.670 --> 16:05.510
No pair cultivation! I refuse!

16:05.540 --> 16:07.150
How can we untie the threads
without doing it?

16:07.150 --> 16:08.360
I know everything now.

16:08.360 --> 16:10.220
Don't try to take advantage of me.

16:11.300 --> 16:12.500
What do you even know?

16:13.240 --> 16:14.840
You planned this in the first place,

16:14.840 --> 16:16.570
all for this final step, right?

16:16.670 --> 16:18.000
Shady demon, old monster.

16:18.000 --> 16:18.630
You wicked demon!

16:18.630 --> 16:19.660
You're so evil!

16:20.320 --> 16:22.560
You were the one who wrapped
the red threads around my hand,

16:22.560 --> 16:24.020
causing all this trouble.

16:24.150 --> 16:24.600
I...

16:25.170 --> 16:26.870
I still refuse to do pair cultivation!

16:26.870 --> 16:28.540
I don't want it.
I don't want pair cultivation.

16:28.540 --> 16:29.840
I'm an unmarried damsel.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.900
I won't do pair cultivation with you!

16:34.600 --> 16:37.200
The sooner we finish,
the sooner we break free.

16:39.040 --> 16:40.190
Let me go!

16:40.270 --> 16:41.540
Let go of me!

16:42.440 --> 16:43.840
No pair cultivation!

16:44.390 --> 16:46.030
I refuse.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.250
Are you ready?

16:50.140 --> 16:51.700
I'm asking if you're ready.

16:51.790 --> 16:52.670
No, no, no.

16:52.670 --> 16:53.870
I'm not ready. I'm not.

16:53.870 --> 16:54.870
I'm not prepared.

16:55.790 --> 16:56.760
The third phase

16:56.790 --> 16:58.750
requires both parties
bound by the red threads to work together

16:58.750 --> 17:00.210
and master the same spell.

17:00.240 --> 17:02.170
This is demons' pair cultivation.

17:03.000 --> 17:03.960
Just this?

17:04.680 --> 17:06.079
What did you think it was?

17:06.920 --> 17:07.720
Well, then...

17:07.720 --> 17:09.380
Which spell will we practice?

17:11.480 --> 17:12.839
You're no more than a beginner.

17:12.839 --> 17:14.700
And my power is still recovering.

17:14.970 --> 17:16.550
Let's practice the simplest one,

17:16.550 --> 17:17.680
the Fire Technique.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.160
Okay.

17:25.829 --> 17:27.829
I'll teach you the incantation now.

17:27.990 --> 17:29.920
Do I have to recite an incantation?

17:29.920 --> 17:31.400
Can't you just transfer
your spiritual power to me?

17:31.400 --> 17:33.260
Then I'd pull it off right away...

17:42.950 --> 17:43.750
Try again.

17:47.830 --> 17:49.510
I got it. It's the right hand.

17:53.830 --> 17:54.440
Once more.

18:20.120 --> 18:21.790
She's naughty and unruly.

18:22.090 --> 18:23.420
For rapid cultivation,

18:23.430 --> 18:25.690
one must experience
joy, anger, sorrow, and fear

18:25.690 --> 18:26.820
to really master it.

18:38.120 --> 18:39.590
I can't get the hang of it.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.220
It's such a simple spell,

18:42.640 --> 18:43.960
yet you're so lame,

18:44.490 --> 18:47.000
failing to learn
after hundreds of attempts.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.350
Forget about demons;

18:48.960 --> 18:50.070
even among humans,

18:50.470 --> 18:51.800
you're a complete fool.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.510
Utterly hopeless.

18:53.830 --> 18:55.290
Who are you calling a fool?

18:55.310 --> 18:56.510
I think you're the incompetent one.

18:56.510 --> 18:58.310
You can't even break a single red thread!

18:58.310 --> 18:59.160
And you call yourself Demon Lord?

18:59.160 --> 19:00.680
You should step down
and let someone else take over.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.370
Anger achieved. Good.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.540
Stop there.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.130
Try again.

19:13.400 --> 19:14.870
There's fire! I've mastered it!

19:14.870 --> 19:16.070
Joy achieved as well.

19:21.790 --> 19:23.660
I told you I couldn't pick it up.

19:23.780 --> 19:24.940
You're fooling me.

19:25.690 --> 19:26.470
Look,

19:26.880 --> 19:28.420
even God is not on your side.

19:37.350 --> 19:38.350
Sorrow achieved.

19:42.000 --> 19:44.770
What happens
if we fail at pair cultivation?

19:50.830 --> 19:51.400
Hey.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.070
Hey!

19:53.510 --> 19:55.170
What do you think will happen?

19:56.310 --> 19:57.770
Don't you know the result?

19:59.510 --> 20:01.250
I don't know!

20:01.760 --> 20:03.020
If we can't untie the threads,

20:03.020 --> 20:04.500
you and I will become one.

20:05.240 --> 20:07.510
You'll end up in my stomach.

20:07.830 --> 20:09.260
No! No! No!

20:09.350 --> 20:09.960
No!

20:09.960 --> 20:11.220
Fear achieved as well.

20:15.050 --> 20:16.790
I've got it! Look!

20:17.350 --> 20:18.350
I've mastered it.

20:18.370 --> 20:19.950
It doesn't extinguish.

20:26.110 --> 20:28.040
They've been removed! Finally!

20:47.110 --> 20:47.880
Fear is

20:48.550 --> 20:50.750
the best way to control people's minds.

20:51.510 --> 20:52.960
Only when they fear you

20:53.400 --> 20:54.720
will they respect you.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.870
When the full moon rises,

20:56.890 --> 20:59.490
I will take you to have a test
in the human world.

20:59.600 --> 21:02.000
Whether you're focused on your studies now

21:02.270 --> 21:04.760
will determine if you can survive that.

21:06.880 --> 21:07.760
Xiao Yao,

21:07.840 --> 21:09.770
don't you know humans the best?

21:09.880 --> 21:11.740
Luoluo and I will rely on you then.

21:13.720 --> 21:14.370
Thank you.

21:20.480 --> 21:22.210
Any unusual human activities?

21:22.750 --> 21:25.160
The Feiyu Guards are
encouraging human demon hunters

21:25.160 --> 21:27.820
to search for demons
with high spiritual power.

21:27.840 --> 21:29.920
They say,
regardless of status or background,

21:29.920 --> 21:31.480
whoever captures a great demon

21:31.480 --> 21:33.640
will receive generous bounties
and high official positions.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.700
This is clearly aimed at you, My Lord.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.340
Now that your wounds are healing,

21:38.830 --> 21:40.680
you must train hard

21:41.110 --> 21:42.770
and stop focusing on Xiao Yao.

21:44.310 --> 21:46.640
A battle with the Feiyu Guard
is inevitable.

21:46.640 --> 21:48.040
There's no need to avoid.

21:48.270 --> 21:49.930
With my current cultivation,

21:50.070 --> 21:51.600
I can deal with them easily.

21:52.410 --> 21:53.000
Xiao Mu.

21:54.530 --> 21:56.490
What has Hei Wu been up to lately?

21:57.750 --> 21:58.670
Hei Wu?

21:59.330 --> 22:00.930
He hasn't made any moves yet.

22:00.960 --> 22:02.620
But his subordinate Wu Huan is

22:02.790 --> 22:04.790
arranging for all the minor demons
at Moon-Gazing Terrace

22:04.790 --> 22:06.480
to take a test in the human realm.

22:06.480 --> 22:07.200
Take a test.

22:09.880 --> 22:10.470
A reward.

22:12.990 --> 22:14.560
This is my personal possession.

22:14.560 --> 22:15.290
You will soon

22:15.290 --> 22:16.850
take a test in the human realm.

22:16.850 --> 22:18.250
If you encounter danger,

22:18.360 --> 22:19.880
hold this jade pendant tightly

22:19.880 --> 22:21.250
and call me with your thoughts.

22:21.250 --> 22:22.830
Will you definitely appear?

22:22.830 --> 22:24.230
Sure, I'll keep you safe.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.000
Okay.

22:27.060 --> 22:27.720
That's all.

22:41.720 --> 22:42.550
As I said,

22:42.880 --> 22:44.240
only in times of danger.

22:46.540 --> 22:49.070
The village below
is called Lantern Village.

22:49.400 --> 22:52.270
Humans think hanging lanterns
can ward off evil

22:52.270 --> 22:53.930
and protect them from demons.

22:53.960 --> 22:55.160
Utterly ridiculous.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.030
This village

22:57.030 --> 22:59.160
is the testing ground for your trials.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.310
What you need to do

23:01.900 --> 23:04.300
is to find a household,

23:04.550 --> 23:05.310
then

23:05.590 --> 23:07.440
frighten a child to tears,

23:08.400 --> 23:10.410
and bring back a pillow.

23:10.790 --> 23:12.960
And you'll pass the test.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.070
That's too difficult.

23:14.070 --> 23:14.960
And we have to take a pillow?

23:14.960 --> 23:15.830
They're all asleep.

23:15.830 --> 23:17.890
I mean, taking their pillow, really?

23:19.920 --> 23:22.220
Remember, no matter what happens,

23:22.400 --> 23:24.200
before the first rooster crows,

23:24.540 --> 23:25.990
you must return here.

23:26.110 --> 23:26.840
Understand?

23:26.950 --> 23:27.590
Got it.

23:27.880 --> 23:28.480
Got it.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.030
Yes.

23:29.030 --> 23:30.630
What if we can't make it back?

23:30.920 --> 23:32.380
If there are no questions,

23:33.100 --> 23:34.300
the test begins.

23:35.750 --> 23:36.350
A head start?

23:36.350 --> 23:37.550
Xiao Yao, wait for us!

23:37.550 --> 23:38.350
Xiao Yao!

23:44.920 --> 23:45.650
My Lord,

23:46.410 --> 23:47.740
when do we make our move?

23:48.920 --> 23:49.480
No rush.

23:51.180 --> 23:53.100
Catching these few minor demons

23:54.790 --> 23:56.990
would be a waste of such a big operation.

24:01.680 --> 24:03.940
This pillow-stealing folk trick

24:04.510 --> 24:06.550
is something I mastered as a child.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.110
Fellow demons,

24:09.350 --> 24:10.590
farewell.

24:12.240 --> 24:12.970
Xiao Yao!

24:13.750 --> 24:14.310
Xiao Yao!

24:14.720 --> 24:15.410
Xiao Yao!

24:16.230 --> 24:16.850
Xiao Yao.

24:16.880 --> 24:17.550
Xiao Yao.

24:20.980 --> 24:21.310
I...

24:21.310 --> 24:22.000
Xiao Yao,

24:22.000 --> 24:23.680
just thinking about our past experiences

24:23.680 --> 24:24.940
makes our legs go weak—

24:24.960 --> 24:25.780
let alone

24:25.960 --> 24:27.200
trying to scare humans.

24:27.200 --> 24:28.880
It's fine. Humans aren't scary.

24:28.880 --> 24:29.900
Go on, hurry up.

24:30.480 --> 24:30.880
Look,

24:30.880 --> 24:33.550
Luoluo is so scared
he's practically speaking pig language.

24:33.550 --> 24:34.310
Xiao Yao,

24:34.310 --> 24:36.440
aren't you the best
at dealing with humans?

24:36.440 --> 24:37.790
Could you help us two?

24:37.790 --> 24:38.650
Please.

24:48.270 --> 24:49.600
You two wait for me here.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.200
Thank you, Xiao Yao.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.830
Hurry, hurry.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.440
Let's hide, come on.

26:42.510 --> 26:43.950
Why isn't she back yet?

26:44.110 --> 26:45.640
Could something have happened?

26:45.640 --> 26:46.270
Impossible.

26:46.270 --> 26:47.270
Xiao Yao is so clever.

26:47.270 --> 26:48.530
Nothing will go wrong.

26:52.590 --> 26:53.390
Xiao Yao!

26:54.440 --> 26:55.110
Got it.

26:55.110 --> 26:55.970
Thank you.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.350
Let's hurry and go.

26:57.350 --> 26:57.900
Let's go.

27:00.270 --> 27:01.160
You go ahead.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.860
I need to go back for my pillow.

27:03.720 --> 27:06.120
-We'll wait for you.
-Xiao Yao, be careful.

27:14.830 --> 27:16.200
Why did the demon-subduing talisman

27:16.200 --> 27:18.680
mistake me for a demon just now?

27:19.640 --> 27:21.710
Could it be true, as Hong Ye said,

27:21.820 --> 27:23.590
that I've been tainted
with demonic energy,

27:23.590 --> 27:26.160
which will bring deadly trouble
to my dad and me

27:26.160 --> 27:28.310
and make me unable
to return to the human realm?

27:28.310 --> 27:30.240
Help! Someone, come quickly!

27:30.240 --> 27:32.400
Catch demons! Catch demons!

27:36.680 --> 27:37.510
Luoluo!

27:37.510 --> 27:38.570
Come here quickly!

27:38.880 --> 27:39.710
Come here!

27:40.270 --> 27:41.030
Where are they?

27:41.030 --> 27:41.480
Where?

27:41.480 --> 27:42.080
Over here!

27:43.070 --> 27:43.790
Hurry!

27:44.590 --> 27:45.520
Coming! Coming!

27:45.590 --> 27:46.550
Catch him! Quick!

27:46.550 --> 27:47.400
Don't let him escape!

27:47.400 --> 27:48.660
Don't let him get away!

27:49.830 --> 27:50.640
Quick! Over here!

27:50.640 --> 27:51.480
It's over here!

27:51.480 --> 27:52.180
Catch him!

27:53.510 --> 27:54.550
Where do you think you're going?

27:54.550 --> 27:56.350
Where do you think you're going?

27:58.000 --> 27:58.790
Tie him up!

27:58.790 --> 27:59.480
Tie him up!

27:59.480 --> 28:00.000
Hold him down!

28:00.000 --> 28:00.880
Pin him down!

28:04.350 --> 28:05.030
Tie him up!

28:05.790 --> 28:06.480
Hit him!

28:07.510 --> 28:08.200
Beat him!

28:08.990 --> 28:09.670
Xiao Yao!

28:11.110 --> 28:12.240
Xiao Yao! Luoluo...

28:13.110 --> 28:14.570
Luoluo has been captured!

28:16.310 --> 28:16.920
Go that way.

28:16.920 --> 28:18.050
No humans are there.

28:18.070 --> 28:19.430
What about Luoluo?

28:19.790 --> 28:21.520
I'll figure something out. Go.

28:26.270 --> 28:27.870
Where do you think you can go?

28:34.540 --> 28:35.340
Run if you can!

28:37.010 --> 28:38.010
Behave yourself!

28:38.400 --> 28:39.930
See if you dare to run again!

28:40.960 --> 28:42.140
Look at his fat face and big ears.

28:42.140 --> 28:44.270
Eating him will surely be nutritious.

28:48.920 --> 28:50.200
Leave the pig ears to me.

28:50.200 --> 28:52.730
We've got something
to go with our drinks now.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.570
He's still grunting here.

29:02.920 --> 29:03.550
What is this?

29:03.550 --> 29:04.160
Pillow.

29:11.920 --> 29:12.510
Sir.

29:16.160 --> 29:16.890
Two pillows.

29:22.880 --> 29:25.610
Remember, doing too much
leads to more mistakes.

29:25.680 --> 29:28.010
Being too showy will also cost you points.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.510
Bamboo.

29:31.590 --> 29:32.240
I asked for one,

29:32.240 --> 29:33.350
yet you gave me two.

29:34.270 --> 29:35.350
Lowest grade.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.110
Well...

29:36.820 --> 29:37.440
I...

29:41.750 --> 29:42.880
Who else hasn't returned?

29:42.880 --> 29:43.550
Xiao Yao.

29:43.790 --> 29:44.550
And Luoluo.

29:44.680 --> 29:46.000
Dali hasn't come back either.

29:46.000 --> 29:46.920
Sir!

29:47.310 --> 29:48.310
Sir!

29:49.510 --> 29:51.910
Luoluo has been captured by humans!

29:53.200 --> 29:54.000
At this hour,

29:54.640 --> 29:55.440
he must be in the cooking pot by now.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.160
Shut up!

29:56.240 --> 29:57.240
Where's Xiao Yao?

29:57.240 --> 29:58.480
Xiao Yao has gone to save him.

29:58.480 --> 29:59.830
But she's all alone.

29:59.830 --> 30:01.030
There are so many humans.

30:01.030 --> 30:02.030
We need to go help her.

30:02.030 --> 30:02.480
Hurry!

30:04.110 --> 30:04.790
No rush.

30:05.940 --> 30:07.330
The test isn't over yet.

30:08.070 --> 30:09.480
If they want to survive,

30:09.850 --> 30:12.310
they'll have to
rely on their own abilities.

30:12.480 --> 30:14.240
Then they'll really end up in the pot.

30:14.240 --> 30:14.970
At daybreak,

30:15.030 --> 30:16.480
we'll beat drums and gongs

30:16.480 --> 30:18.070
and go to the magistrate's office
for our reward.

30:18.070 --> 30:19.750
Let everyone for miles around know

30:19.750 --> 30:21.240
that we have real skills!

30:21.440 --> 30:21.790
Right!

30:21.790 --> 30:22.270
Yes!

30:22.270 --> 30:23.510
Bring the black dog's blood!

30:23.510 --> 30:24.320
Here.

30:35.240 --> 30:37.790
Xiao Dadan,

30:38.510 --> 30:41.570
your life ends here.

30:46.600 --> 30:48.540
Xiao Dadan,

30:48.750 --> 30:51.030
your sins of killing are too great.

30:51.170 --> 30:53.310
Cheating and swindling all day long.

30:53.330 --> 30:54.890
I have come today

30:55.070 --> 30:59.510
to make you pay for your debts.

31:04.920 --> 31:05.760
Nonsense!

31:05.880 --> 31:07.520
I've never killed anyone!

31:07.670 --> 31:09.270
How can you say
my sins of killing are great?

31:09.270 --> 31:10.930
Don't try to play tricks here!

31:11.750 --> 31:13.510
We even catch demons!

31:14.070 --> 31:20.960
Today, I will seek justice from you all!

31:28.720 --> 31:29.390
Spare me!

31:29.420 --> 31:30.200
Have mercy!

31:30.200 --> 31:30.790
We...

31:30.790 --> 31:31.960
We know we were wrong.

31:31.960 --> 31:33.240
We'll never dare to do it again!

31:33.240 --> 31:34.000
Please spare us!

31:34.000 --> 31:34.870
Never again!

31:36.030 --> 31:37.420
I beg you to spare me!

31:38.400 --> 31:39.110
Have mercy!

31:42.790 --> 31:43.920
Please let us go!

31:57.960 --> 31:59.160
Don't let him escape!

31:59.160 --> 31:59.720
Boss!

31:59.880 --> 32:00.400
Boss!

32:00.640 --> 32:01.370
He's a demon!

32:01.480 --> 32:02.830
Splash him with black dog's blood!

32:02.830 --> 32:03.310
Splash him!

32:03.310 --> 32:04.960
I'm going for it!

32:07.640 --> 32:08.640
Let's go, come on!

32:18.000 --> 32:18.720
My Lord.

32:24.920 --> 32:27.030
This fluorite powder
is colorless and odorless.

32:27.030 --> 32:29.090
Neither humans nor demons can see it.

32:29.400 --> 32:31.750
Only fluorescent light can reveal it.

32:34.030 --> 32:36.160
My Lord, you're indeed brilliant.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.110
This time,

32:38.960 --> 32:40.640
I'll let these minor demons

32:41.440 --> 32:43.500
lead us to the lair of the great demon.

32:45.920 --> 32:48.050
Who hasn't turned in their pillow yet?

32:51.310 --> 32:53.170
Didn't you already submit yours?

32:53.200 --> 32:53.680
Yes.

32:58.510 --> 32:59.720
You three, right?

33:01.220 --> 33:02.330
Just those two.

33:06.240 --> 33:07.640
It was such a simple task,

33:08.590 --> 33:10.070
and you two not only failed to complete it

33:10.070 --> 33:11.680
but also brought trouble upon yourselves.

33:11.680 --> 33:12.640
You're utterly foolish

33:12.640 --> 33:13.970
and beyond redemption!

33:14.270 --> 33:15.870
Go to Pipa Cave immediately,

33:16.030 --> 33:16.880
and without seeing daylight,

33:16.880 --> 33:17.940
reflect for a year.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.480
It's just a test.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.480
We failed, and we'll accept punishment.

33:24.480 --> 33:25.510
Even a beating would be fine.

33:25.510 --> 33:26.640
But why solitary confinement?

33:26.640 --> 33:27.880
Failing the test is a minor issue,

33:27.880 --> 33:30.010
but you two exposed your whereabouts,

33:30.270 --> 33:32.920
putting every fellow disciple in danger.

33:35.510 --> 33:36.970
It's not Xiao Yao's fault.

33:37.350 --> 33:39.000
I'm the one
who brought trouble to everyone.

33:39.000 --> 33:40.340
If I could choose again,

33:40.400 --> 33:41.880
I would still save Luoluo.

33:41.940 --> 33:43.240
In the rules of the Demons' Valley,

33:43.240 --> 33:45.370
isn't life more important than a test?

33:45.400 --> 33:47.240
Please give me a chance
to retake the test.

33:47.240 --> 33:49.550
Since when has the Demons' Valley
ever allowed retakes?

33:49.550 --> 33:52.150
Those rules weren't there
from the beginning.

33:52.550 --> 33:54.030
If I fail the retake...

33:55.510 --> 33:56.370
Yeah.

33:57.480 --> 33:59.740
We're willing to accept any punishment.

34:00.960 --> 34:01.960
Count me in too.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.270
Xiao Yao gave me my pillow,

34:04.270 --> 34:06.200
so I should retake the test as well.

34:10.230 --> 34:10.960
Are you sure?

34:11.030 --> 34:11.550
Yes.

34:12.630 --> 34:14.190
Bring back 3 human heads.

34:16.550 --> 34:18.280
And you'll pass the test.

34:18.280 --> 34:20.630
No harm has ever been done to humans
in the tests of the Demons' Valley,

34:20.630 --> 34:22.190
let alone murder.

34:22.190 --> 34:22.550
Yeah.

34:22.550 --> 34:23.630
This goes against our rules.

34:23.630 --> 34:24.400
Rules?

34:24.400 --> 34:26.400
Retakes aren't in the rules either.

34:26.440 --> 34:28.230
When he was nearly killed just now,

34:28.230 --> 34:29.400
you were willing to risk yourself

34:29.400 --> 34:31.400
rather than kill humans to save him.

34:31.670 --> 34:32.360
Xiao Yao,

34:32.750 --> 34:34.610
since you care so much for humans,

34:36.320 --> 34:39.920
does that mean your loyalty
is no longer with the Demons' Valley?

34:43.190 --> 34:44.920
You smell of the outside world.

34:57.000 --> 34:57.630
What's this?

34:57.630 --> 34:58.360
Footprints.

35:00.590 --> 35:01.850
All the way over there.

35:07.760 --> 35:08.620
Lift your foot.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.740
Lift your foot!

35:16.230 --> 35:17.070
Her footprints.

35:17.070 --> 35:18.200
They're identical.

35:18.550 --> 35:19.810
Where did it come from?

35:20.190 --> 35:21.110
I don't know where I picked it up.

35:21.110 --> 35:22.340
I don't know.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.070
What is this?

35:23.070 --> 35:24.440
This is fluorite powder.

35:24.440 --> 35:25.440
Fluorite powder?

35:26.670 --> 35:29.630
You've left a trail
from the human realm to the demon realm.

35:29.630 --> 35:30.280
Xiao Yao,

35:30.760 --> 35:33.320
are you trying to lead humans
into the Demons' Valley?

35:33.320 --> 35:33.880
What?

35:56.780 --> 35:58.260
So the key to this barrier

35:58.290 --> 35:59.620
is the fluorite powder.

36:01.440 --> 36:02.570
Such a precious land

36:02.670 --> 36:04.280
has been occupied by a bunch of demons.

36:04.280 --> 36:05.340
Truly detestable.

36:06.760 --> 36:07.230
My Lord.

36:07.670 --> 36:08.230
For this expedition,

36:08.230 --> 36:09.670
we have the imperial divine weapon.

36:09.670 --> 36:10.710
Let's end this quickly

36:10.710 --> 36:11.960
by forcing that great demon out.

36:11.960 --> 36:13.510
The divine weapon is too destructive.

36:13.510 --> 36:14.440
Once activated,

36:15.150 --> 36:17.080
this precious land will be ruined.

36:17.600 --> 36:18.230
My Lord.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.320
Since His Majesty
has bestowed the divine weapon,

36:20.320 --> 36:22.710
he wants us to eliminate all evil.

36:42.960 --> 36:43.690
Feiyu Guard!

36:43.800 --> 36:44.760
Execute heaven's will!

36:44.760 --> 36:45.880
Slay demons and vanquish evil!

36:45.880 --> 36:47.010
Form the formation!

37:20.430 --> 37:22.020
W-What's happening?

37:29.400 --> 37:30.080
Xiao Yao!

37:30.170 --> 37:34.730
♪ Desires pile up
across the silent wilderness ♪

37:30.320 --> 37:30.880
Hurry!

37:33.440 --> 37:33.800
Run!

37:37.110 --> 37:37.630
Hurry up!

37:37.150 --> 37:40.430
♪ What in life is truly worth
longing for? ♪

37:37.780 --> 37:38.150
Run quickly!

37:38.150 --> 37:38.760
Get up! Get up!

37:38.760 --> 37:39.670
Xiao Yao, run!

37:40.440 --> 37:41.560
Carry her, Luoluo!

37:44.030 --> 37:48.470
♪ In the cycle of reincarnation,
all beings are boundless and ordinary ♪

37:44.230 --> 37:45.000
Get up!

37:45.360 --> 37:46.550
Run, Xiao Yao!

37:50.270 --> 37:54.710
♪ How can one judge demons
and specters by mere appearances? ♪

37:51.400 --> 37:52.480
Xiao Yao, run!

37:56.780 --> 38:01.400
♪ You forge your obsession
into vermilion around your fingers ♪

38:02.580 --> 38:04.290
You could have escaped in the test.

38:03.780 --> 38:08.270
♪ Crossing ten thousand years
to redeem me in the vast desolation ♪

38:04.430 --> 38:05.630
Why did you come back?

38:06.380 --> 38:07.510
My friends are here.

38:10.740 --> 38:13.200
♪ All beings chase the seas of desire,
weaving nets of greed and hatred ♪

38:11.070 --> 38:11.550
Go.

38:12.150 --> 38:12.550
Hurry!

38:14.130 --> 38:16.620
♪ Only when suffering's carved into
steles do we realize it's karmic burden ♪

38:17.650 --> 38:22.670
♪ Only by burning the heart to ashes
can one end the vanity in karma ♪

38:21.030 --> 38:24.290
Everything is proceeding
according to your plan, Master.

38:24.580 --> 38:26.980
♪ When the world laughs at my obsession ♪

38:25.440 --> 38:26.000
Yes.

38:27.920 --> 38:30.370
♪ Only you can understand
my most fervent faith ♪

38:31.330 --> 38:35.040
♪ Let all beings bloom again,
breaking free from the shackles of fate ♪

38:36.030 --> 38:37.660
♪ In the end, it's not in vain ♪

38:44.550 --> 38:45.610
Take all the demons

38:45.710 --> 38:46.760
to hide in Youning Cave.

38:46.760 --> 38:48.690
Not a single one can be left behind.

38:52.530 --> 38:56.970
♪ In the cycle of reincarnation,
all beings are boundless and ordinary ♪

38:58.510 --> 39:03.120
♪ How can one judge demons
and specters by mere appearances? ♪

38:59.920 --> 39:00.670
You go ahead!

39:00.670 --> 39:01.440
I'll be right back!

39:01.440 --> 39:02.550
Where are you going?

39:02.550 --> 39:03.110
Xiao Yao!

39:03.510 --> 39:04.640
Where are you going?

39:05.280 --> 39:09.830
♪ You forge your obsession
into vermilion around your fingers ♪

39:07.510 --> 39:09.640
This place can't be saved. Go quickly!

39:12.120 --> 39:16.560
♪ Crossing ten thousand years
to redeem me in the vast desolation ♪

39:12.800 --> 39:14.700
Listen, homes can be rebuilt.

39:14.720 --> 39:16.980
If you don't leave now, it'll be too late.

39:19.060 --> 39:21.580
♪ All beings chase the seas of desire,
weaving nets of greed and hatred ♪

39:22.570 --> 39:24.970
♪ Only when suffering's carved into
steles do we realize it's karmic burden ♪

39:26.050 --> 39:30.820
♪ Only by burning the heart to ashes
can one end the vanity in karma ♪

39:32.940 --> 39:35.340
♪ When the world laughs at my obsession ♪

39:36.320 --> 39:38.730
♪ Only you can understand
my most fervent faith ♪

39:39.730 --> 39:43.240
♪ Let all beings bloom again,
breaking free from the shackles of fate ♪

39:44.420 --> 39:46.110
♪ In the end, it's not in vain ♪

39:55.150 --> 39:55.840
Master.

39:55.920 --> 39:58.800
This is Zhuyu herbs' last dwelling place.

39:59.360 --> 40:02.640
They've lived here for thousands of years.

40:02.760 --> 40:04.700
They won't leave.

40:04.920 --> 40:08.280
My presence here is enough.

40:09.910 --> 40:13.890
♪ Burned to ashes,
the world vast and desolate ♪

40:26.760 --> 40:28.920
This great demon's power is unfathomable.

40:28.920 --> 40:31.150
Commander Ji, you should withdraw first.

40:31.150 --> 40:32.630
Otherwise, if the battle breaks out,

40:32.630 --> 40:34.110
I'll have to split my focus
to protect you.

40:34.110 --> 40:34.710
Very well.

40:35.510 --> 40:36.640
Be careful, My Lord.

40:36.710 --> 40:38.040
Feiyu Guard, withdraw!

40:42.590 --> 40:43.120
Let's go.

40:45.190 --> 40:47.550
We're going to save the Demons' Valley
from destruction.
